@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@providerToken = REPLACE_WITH_BOOKFLOW_PROVIDER_TOKEN_FROM_IGNORED_ENV

### Demo author token; use other known roles for their tokens
GET {{baseUrl}}/tokens/Author
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}

### Synthetic proofprint
POST {{baseUrl}}/proofprints
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: proofprint-demo
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

Example manuscript

### Synthetic print order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: order-demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"bookId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","title":"Example","isbn":"9780306406157","distributorId":"distributor","quantity":100}

### Synthetic email
POST {{baseUrl}}/emails
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: email-demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"destination":"author@example.test","template":"manuscript-approved","link":"http://localhost:8080/","publisherApi":false}

### Synthetic publisher availability
POST {{baseUrl}}/publisher-notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: publisher-demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"destination":"publisher","template":"book-orderable","link":"http://localhost:8080/","publisherApi":true}

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Provider OpenAPI requires the provider token
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
